DESCRIPTION:Amber Wallin is a comedian\, host\, and storyteller based in LA
 \, specializing in lifestyle\, comedy\, and parenting content. With over 3 
 million followers across her social platforms\, she captivates audiences wi
 th humor\, engaging anecdotes about her family with her "Toddler Grievances
 " series\, serenading her indoor plants\, and creating quirky characters in
 spired by her wig collection. She has performed stand-up comedy at renowned
  venues such as The Comedy Store\, Hollywood Improv\, The Second City\, and
  Flappers Comedy Club. Along with Jazmyn W\, she co-hosts the podcast Quit 
 Playin' on Bob the Drag Queen's Purse First network. She is a regular mains
 tage host for NPR's The Moth.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium 
 seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket 
